{"unit_id":"Mg-K-Mn__dsh-plugin-manager#card-zh","repo":"Mg-K-Mn/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"e268ca99c87c8b37458756947c3a43cd203c6ba6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-manager 是面向 DSH Web 的已安装插件管理器，在设置的插件页面提供管理面板。宿主端注册 API 并读取 profile 依赖、Cordis 补丁和 Loader 运行条目，浏览器端展示插件版本、状态和详情。用户可以按名称、描述或条目 ID 搜索，查看启用、禁用、部分启用及加载失败状态，并为有 Cordis 入口的插件切换状态；未接线的插件可写入入口声明，补丁变化后等待运行时更新。它适合需要在 DSH Web 中查看和管理 profile 插件的用户。无需额外 API 密钥；使用 DSH Web 提供的服务，可选通过 DSH_HOME 指定数据目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:348-453","lib/host.js:479-590","lib/host.js:592-637","lib/client.js:312-388"]}
{"unit_id":"Mg-K-Mn__dsh-plugin-manager#card-en","repo":"Mg-K-Mn/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"e268ca99c87c8b37458756947c3a43cd203c6ba6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-manager adds a plugin panel to DSH Web settings. It lists profile plugins and Loader states, with search by name, description, source, or entry ID. Users can toggle wired entries or add a downloaded plugin’s Cordis rows. It uses DSH Web services and needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:348-453","lib/host.js:479-590","lib/host.js:592-637","lib/client.js:312-388"]}
