{"unit_id":"Mg-K-Mn__dsh-plugin-manager#feature-1","repo":"Mg-K-Mn/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"e268ca99c87c8b37458756947c3a43cd203c6ba6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-manager 的功能「插件列表与状态」：在设置的已安装插件页列出 profile 依赖，并显示版本、描述、运行条目和启用状态。页面加载或点击刷新时向宿主 API 请求列表数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:267-294","lib/host.js:348-453"]}
