{"unit_id":"Mg-K-Mn__dsh-plugin-manager#feature-4","repo":"Mg-K-Mn/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"e268ca99c87c8b37458756947c3a43cd203c6ba6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-manager 的功能「未接线入口处理」：对尚无运行条目的已下载插件，点击启用会将插件补丁中的 insert 入口追加到 profile 补丁，再轮询运行条目确认是否出现。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:504-524","lib/host.js:307-326"]}
